{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53086","headline":"过郑山人所居 · 刘长卿","name":"过郑山人所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一迳人寻谷口村，春山犬吠武陵源。\n青苔满地无行处，深咲桃花独闭门。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷一五○收本诗，内容大异，今重录。\n《千载佳句》卷上《人事部·闲居》收後二句，诗题不同，《全唐诗逸》卷上已收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}